# [Finance Tracker](https://name-hansel.github.io/finance-tracker/)

Track your Salary, Spending, and Credit Card accounts in one place — no more Excel sheets.

- Log money coming in, going out, or moving between your accounts
- Tag every transaction so you can see exactly where your money goes
- Get a dashboard with spending trends, top categories, credit card payback tracking, and how long your money will last

Your data stays 100% private. No server, no sign-up, no internet needed — everything is saved automatically, right in your browser, on your device only. Nothing is ever sent anywhere.

- Close the tab, restart your laptop, come back later — your data is still there
- Export a backup file anytime, and import it back whenever you need
- You're always in full control of your data